 -1)\n     $$\n\nSo, Bill ends up at the point:  \n$$\n\\left(\\frac{3}{4}, -1\\right)\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Find the straight-line distance from the origin\n\nWe use the **distance formula** between two points $(x_1, y_1)$ and $(x_2, y_2)$:\n\n$$\n\\text{Distance} = \\sqrt{(x_2 - x_1)^2 + (y_2 - y_1)^2}\n$$\n\nHere, the starting point is $(0, 0)$, and the final point is $\\left(\\frac{3}{4}, -1\\right)$, so:\n\n$$\n\\text{Distance} = \\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{3}{4} - 0\\right)^2 + \\left(-1 - 0\\right)^2}\n= \\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)^2 + (-1)^2}\n$$\n\n$$\n= \\sqrt{\\frac{9}{16} + 1} = \\sqrt{\\frac{9}{16} + \\frac{16}{16}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{25}{16}} = \\frac{5}{4}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Convert to decimal\n\n$$\n\\frac{5}{4} = 1.25\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{1.25}\n$$", "draft_calls": 833, "input_ids": [151644, 872, 198, 27476, 22479, 57960, 37018, 90, 16, 15170, 17, 31716, 14587, 9806, 11, 1221, 57960, 37018, 90, 18, 15170, 19, 31716, 14587, 10984, 11, 323, 5499, 57960, 37018, 90, 16, 15170, 17, 31716, 14587, 9806, 13, 2585, 1657, 8756, 374, 566, 11, 304, 264, 2118, 1555, 11, 504, 806, 5916, 1459, 30, 220, 17399, 697, 4226, 438, 264, 12122, 311, 279, 23480, 7739, 339, 624, 5501, 2874, 3019, 553, 3019, 11, 323, 2182, 697, 1590, 4226, 2878, 1124, 79075, 46391, 151645, 198, 151644, 77091, 198, 151667, 271, 151668, 271], "input_tokens": 91, "method": "sd2_selected", "output_hash": "ccb3f9824e5be7da3cbf7b3920e847848aee4a876e56e8af315d4332afc770ff", "output_ids": [1654, 525, 2661, 429, 8596, 22479, 304, 2326, 17961, 1447, 16, 13, 3070, 58736, 37018, 90, 16, 15170, 17, 31716, 14587, 9806, 1019, 17, 13, 3070, 58736, 37018, 90, 18, 15170, 19, 31716, 14587, 10984, 1019, 18, 13, 3070, 58736, 37018, 90, 16, 15170, 17, 31716, 14587, 9806, 56177, 1654, 525, 311, 1477, 1246, 3041, 566, 374, 504, 806, 3070, 39289, 1459, 334, 304, 264, 3070, 19798, 1555, 97219, 600, 1734, 2572, 279, 3070, 88192, 8447, 6010, 334, 504, 806, 1590, 2309, 311, 806, 